linden-bsp provides CMake targets:

    find_package(linden_bsp CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE linden::linden_bsp)

Features:
  - hik: Enable Hikvision camera driver (default ON)
    Install with: vcpkg install linden-bsp[hik]
    Or without:   vcpkg install linden-bsp[core]

Note: The [hik] feature requires Hikvision MVS SDK installed at /opt/MVS
or set the MVCAM_SDK_PATH environment variable before building.
